          "body": "Hi Ismael,\n\nThanks,\n\nthere is a always this warning :\n\n```\npacket-rtps.c:2986:60: warning: Access to field 'base_type_id' results in a dereference of a null pointer (loaded from variable 'info') [core.NullDereference]\npacket-rtps.c:3094:21: warning: Access to field 'base_type_id' results in a dereference of a null pointer (loaded from variable 'info') [core.NullDereference]\npacket-rtps.c:3205:21: warning: Access to field 'base_type_id' results in a dereference of a null pointer (loaded from variable 'info') [core.NullDereference]\npacket-rtps.c:3573:86: warning: The right operand of '==' is a garbage value [core.UndefinedBinaryOperatorResult]\n```",
